lass=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"42\"> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"42\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"42\">Akai Professional MPK261 MIDI Keyboard</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"99\"> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"99\">In lichtgebruikte staat, geleverd met stofkap en kabel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"702\"> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"702\">🎹 Model: Akai Professional MPK261<br data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"138\">🎵 Type: USB/MIDI keyboard controller<br data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"178\">🎼 Toetsen: 61 semi-gewogen toetsen met aftertouch<br data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"231\">🎛️ Bediening: 16 RGB MPC-pads, 8 faders, 8 draaiknoppen en diverse transportbedieningselementen<br data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"330\" data-is-only-node=\"\">⚙️ Specificaties: MPC Note Repeat, Full Level en uitgebreide DAW-integratie<br data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"408\">💻 Compatibiliteit: Geschikt voor Ableton Live, FL Studio, Logic Pro, Cubase, Studio One en andere DAW-software<br data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"522\">📶 Connectiviteit: USB, MIDI In en MIDI Out<br data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"568\">✨ Extra: Ideaal voor muziekproductie, live performances en studio-opnames<br data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"644\">📦 Accessoires: Stofkap + kabel<br data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"678\">📦 Garantie: 3 maanden</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>",
